 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "To Shake You"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "너를 흔들다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "When she was twenty, she quietly kept Seokjoo in her heart.\n\nNow, she was face-to-face with the man who had once left without a word.\n\n\"Director.\"\n\n\"Drop the formalities. Call me like you used to.\"\n\n\"...Sunbae.\"\n\nShe clearly still had no intention of ever calling him oppa.\n\nWell, he could wait to hear the word he really wanted—eventually.\n\nHe looked at her, daring her to say more.\n\n\"When I was assigned to your office, was this what you had in mind?\"\n\n\"No.\"\n\n\"Then why, all of a sudden...\"\n\n\"Because you kept going on those damn blind dates.\"\n\nIf he touched her now, he’d lose all control—and he’d make her cry.\n\nSo he waited. Just a little longer. At his own pace.\n\n\"How far are you planning to go with me?\"\n\nWith Yoon Jiwon... how far?\n\nI'll just take you.\n\nAgain."
  },
